# Third-party trees
#
# No vendor Kconfig is sourced here.  The compatible-license trees the build
# compiles (CherryUSB, lwIP) do not ship a Kconfig, and the GPL driver trees
# must never feed this tree a Kconfig: the values a profile needs are modeled
# in the first-party files, and the source lists stay in the make fragments.
#
# This file exists so the root Kconfig has a stable place to point at when a
# third-party option does become first-class; it currently defines nothing.
